### Criar transação - GROCERIES com createdAt explícito
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Feira semanal",
  "category": "GROCERIES",
  "amount": 8700,
  "createdAt": "2026-08-21T14:30:00Z"
}

